5,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Since it's the first day, we have no information yet. I'll spend this time observing everyone's reactions and speech patterns. Let's see how the conversation develops.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Toshio. Since we have no clues yet, it's best to listen and see how everyone behaves. I'll be paying close attention as well.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. Since we're starting from scratch, let's keep the conversation open. I'm interested to see who among us is most eager to lead and who is staying quiet. Let's be honest with each other.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minato,,"I think it's a good idea to be honest. I'm a bit nervous, but I want to help everyone find the werewolf. I'll listen carefully to what you all have to say.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,It seems we are all in agreement. I will also spend my time listening and reflecting on our words. Let us maintain this peaceful atmosphere while we search for the truth together.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"Since we are all in agreement to observe, I'll keep my thoughts to myself for now. However, I wonder if anyone has a specific strategy for how we should handle the voting tomorrow.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"I think we should base our votes on any contradictions or suspicious behavior that emerges today. If someone seems too eager to deflect or too quiet, we should discuss it before voting.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"That's a logical approach, Misaki. I agree that contradictions are the key. However, we should also be careful not to mistake natural nervousness for guilt, especially since some of us are more reserved than others.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minato,,"I think Mizuki is right. Some people are just shy, so we shouldn't be too mean to them. I'll try my best to be honest, even if I'm a little scared.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I appreciate the kindness in your words, Minato. I agree with Mizuki; we must be careful not to let our biases cloud our judgment. Let us remain patient and gentle with one another as we observe.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Toshio,,It seems we have a shared understanding of the approach. I'll continue to monitor the flow of the conversation. Does anyone have any initial impressions or questions for another player before we conclude the day?,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,I don't have any specific questions yet. I'm still processing everyone's tone and how we're interacting. I'll continue to observe and see if any inconsistencies appear as we move toward the first vote.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I don't have any specific suspicions yet either. However, I'm curious if anyone here feels a particular pressure to act a certain way. Sometimes the most ""perfect"" behavior is the most telling. I'll keep watching.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minato,,"I don't really know how to act ""perfectly,"" so I'll just be myself. I hope we can all get along and find the werewolf without fighting. Does anyone else feel a bit worried?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is natural to feel a bit of anxiety, Minato. This is a challenging game for us all. I believe that by staying calm and trusting in our collective observation, we can find the answer together.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Toshio,,"I've noted everyone's stance. Since we've established a baseline of behavior and a general strategy for tomorrow, I have nothing more to add for today. I'll see you all tomorrow after the first night.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm satisfied with our discussion today. I'll spend the rest of the time reflecting on what everyone has said. Good luck to us all.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I've enjoyed getting a feel for everyone's personality today. Let's hope the first night provides some clarity. I'll be waiting to see what tomorrow brings.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Minato,,I'll do my best to remember everything we talked about. I hope everyone has a peaceful night. See you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a restful night as well. May the truth reveal itself to us in the morning. I will see you all tomorrow.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
